SourceLight for phones — Third-Party Software Notices
=====================================================

This file lists the third-party open-source components in the SourceLight
phone app and reproduces their licences, as those licences require. The Rust
part is generated from the dependency graph by cargo-about (see
mobile/src-tauri/about.toml).

This software is based in part on the work of the Independent JPEG Group.
(The phone's editor encodes its frames with jpeg-encoder, which derives from
the IJG's libjpeg; the IJG licence asks for this line. Its full text is below,
under "Independent JPEG Group License".)

